Z||000009||SLYGUY||10-21-2001||01:28 AM||||Still having that tranny problem Moo?<BR>That blows. <P>Love that orange!!<BR>I'd love to do something like that but a car that noticeable wouldn't stay yours for 10 mins. here in CA.<BR>People steal cars every second everywhere but here in Southern California it is really bad.<BR>Hope you get that bumblebee of a car back on the road soon 'Cow.<P>Sly<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SLYGUYSIG.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||Tigger||10-21-2001||01:48 AM||||Moo, let me know what weekend your going to swap that tranny, I'll make a trip over to help.<P>Thanks Sly.  Around here there's more of a small town atmosphere and it doesn't blend in very well with all the Buick Lesabres and Chevy trucks.  Friends always seem to tell me "Hey, I saw you at..." so I have to be really careful to not park at places I don't want to get noticed.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif">  <P>I don't park at places where I don't want to get noticed so that doesn't bother me much.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 10-21-2001).]||||reg||1
