Z||000015||Nashco||10-21-2001||02:58 AM||||Great pics Tigger!  I like the ant cam..hehe.  I took some "down low" pics of my baja bug before.  Just like it shows how low our cars are, it showed how tall it was.<P>I live in the ghetto of Flint, so I always make sure to park my car in the garage and lock things up.  Two of my roommates got their cars stolen/broken into so far...yikes.<P>Regardless, I'm more worried about losing the car in a pothole than anything else <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Seems like some of those suckers could swallow me whole!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
