Z||000018||Tigger||10-21-2001||10:05 PM||||yo_sweet, I may add the ground effects later...  I don't mind it the way it is now.<P>Beer_stud_21, The camera is a Sony Digital Mavica, not sure if they still make them.  Saves 10-20 pictures on a 3.5" floppy depending on the resolution you use.  For these I used the max 1024x768 and sized them down.  Actually, the quality of the originals are better.  I compressed the resolution of these so they would load faster.  Newer cameras plug into the USB port.<P>Dave, I wanna see your orbit orange Fiero also.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">  I wanted to make Fierorama but I think I had a college final that weekend if I remember right.  Next year I won't have to worry about that so I hope to make it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Nashco, did you notice the lowerer you sit the harder it is to see the potholes.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Banzai, Good to hear.  Maybe we can get another MI meet going before the snow flies.<P>GTFiero1, the zebra seats are kinda for fun really.  They help keep the dirt and wear & tear off the seats.  I take them off at shows.||||reg||1
