Z||000022||jch82||10-22-2001||12:14 AM||||WOW! I still love that orange Tigger!! I can't wait to get the rest of my mods on the good ole 85GT. Then she will get a fresh coat of paint. The paint will be in the spring though.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> This winter Ken and I will hopefully be putting a 3.4 in my fiero!! Just have to find a spot to do the swap. Anyone with a garage? preferably heated!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> LOL  <P>I just love that 'ant cam' pic of Ken's fiero! I didn't even mean to get the grass in there. LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>We should definitely get together before the snow hits! It would be nice to see everyone and their fieros before then. Make sure to let us know a few weeks in advance so I can be sure to get it off work this time!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82flag.jpg"> ||||reg||14
Z||000023||Nashco||10-22-2001||01:01 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tigger:<BR><B>Nashco, did you notice the lowerer you sit the harder it is to see the potholes.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, no kidding.  It's like I need to stick my head out the sunroof just to see what's coming <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Hmm...ya think we should stop lowering our car, and raise it?  *looks over shoulders, then reconsiders*  Ha, what am I saying?  It's never low enough! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
